{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19071","headline":"途次敷水驿伏覩华州舅氏昔日行县题诗处潸然有感 · 刘禹锡","name":"途次敷水驿伏覩华州舅氏昔日行县题诗处潸然有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日股肱守，朱轮兹地游。\n繁华日已谢，章句此空留。\n蔓草佳城闭，故林棠树秋。\n今来重垂泪，不忍过西州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}